on Ja-- Jababia,


00:35:34.915 --> 00:35:37.874
but you know that,
since you speak fluent Jababian.


00:35:38.136 --> 00:35:39.833
Oh.


00:35:40.007 --> 00:35:42.966
Of course. I was just trying
