Always more to learn.


00:35:52.324 --> 00:35:53.629
It's like
a fetish.


00:35:53.803 --> 00:35:55.544
Hah, okay, that implies
something sexual.


00:35:55.718 --> 00:35:56.980
It's definitely not.It is.


00:35:57.198 --> 00:35:58.417
