00:45:27.376 --> 00:45:29.335
Anything at all?
Come on.


00:45:33.252 --> 00:45:34.383
No. Not a thing.


00:45:34.557 --> 00:45:37.125
So just to recap...No point.


00:45:37.299 --> 00:45:38.692
A high-ranking member


00:45:38.866 --> 00:45:41.042
